  "solution": "Để từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> thì phải đi lên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> bước và sang phải <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> bước.<br>Chọn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> bước đi lên trong hành trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math> bước là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></semantics></math> cách.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> bước còn lại đều sang phải <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></semantics></math> cách.<br>Vậy số cách đi từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cách.<br>Tương tự, ta có \n\t\t<ul><li>Số cách đi từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> (lên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> bước và sang phải <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> bước) là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cách.</li><li>Số cách đi từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> (lên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> bước và sang phải <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> bước) là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cách.</li><li>Số cách đi từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cách.</li></ul>\t\n\t\tVậy số cách đi từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://